[59.007769, "o", "\u001b[2m  why  \u001b[22mThe command succeeded, but the agent called an upstream that is neither mocked nor allowed,\r\n"]
[59.007776, "o", "       and a model that recovers from the thrown error would hide that\r\n"]
[59.007817, "o", "\u001b[2m  fix  \u001b[22m\u001b[1mapi.notion.com\u001b[22m\r\n         \u001b[32mmock it \u001b[39m  eve-mocks add notion && eve-mocks pull notion\r\n         \u001b[33mallow it\u001b[39m  mocks/notion.ts: export default allow({ url: \"https://api.notion.com/\" })\r\n"]
[59.007824, "o", "\r\n"]
[59.007875, "o", "       To let such a run pass, add --no-fail-on-block\r\n"]
